protein phosphatases in cell proliferation</article-title><source>Biochim Biophys Acta</source><year>1997</year><volume>1332</volume><supplement>2</supplement><fpage>M53</fpage><lpage>M63</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biochim Biophys Acta||1332|M53||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9141461</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Draetta</surname><given-names>GF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mammalian G1 cyclins</article-title><source>Curr Opin Cell Biol</source><year>1994</year><volume>6</volume><supplement>6</supplement><fpage>842</fpage><lpage>846</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Curr Opin Cell Biol||6|842||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7880531</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eckstein</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cdc25 as a potential target of anticancer agents</article-title><source>Invest New Drugs</source><year>2000</year><volume>18</volume><supplement>2</supplement><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>156</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Invest New Drugs||18|149||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10857994</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fahraeus</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Paramio</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Lain</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inhibition of pRb phosphorylation and cell-cycle progression by a 20-residue peptide derived from p16CDKN2/INK4A</article-title><source>Curr Biol</source><year>1996</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>84</fpage><lpage>91</lpage><!--Pub